{"id":841727,"title":"03｜对话初体验","content":"本节课介绍了科技IDE中的几种对话模式：chat、composer、自动补全和内嵌对话。Chat模式不直接生成文件，需手动点击应用按钮将代码写入本地；composer模式则能自动创建并修改文件，支持普通和agent模式，后者可自动安装所需第三方库。演示了使用chat模式生成并修改冒泡排序Python文件的过程，强调了接受或拒绝更改的重要性。自动补全功能通过上下文智能建议代码片段，提高编码效率。内嵌对话窗口用于解释代码、添加注释或生成内容，可通过选中代码或快捷键调用。此外，说明了如何利用IDE访问国外大模型如GPT-4，实现无需科学上网的高效开发与写作辅助。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":399489,"user_name":"Geek_db7831","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3578839,"ip_address":"浙江","ucode":"BD38AE113E3750","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1744412242,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":145048,"content":"使用MANUAL模式和agent模式是可以自动创建文件的，后面的示例部分都有创建文件的演示","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1744547383,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":399489,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"要怎么创建文件呢？没有讲到","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":659635,"discussion_content":"使用MANUAL模式和agent模式是可以自动创建文件的，后面的示例部分都有创建文件的演示","content_length":45,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1744547383,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":398705,"user_name":"MadleS_F","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1670997,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"D6B6C29F576B7A","user_header":"http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eoV9IsMsiawicpaaTXqhPzqH2mA5HUKUSyJ5fbUhoqTKhNRxJ5dibhs5bkTqCSqcuolZT7sam2sn8sBA/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1741962682,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144657,"content":"确实，新版本界面发生了变化。chat和composer合并到了一起，通过选项进行区分了。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1742113374,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":398705,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"新版的界面好像跟老师讲的不一样了,囧","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":658548,"discussion_content":"确实，新版本界面发生了变化。chat和composer合并到了一起，通过选项进行区分了。","content_length":44,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1742113374,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":401749,"user_name":"Geek_719618","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4309400,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"B452FA9968632F","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1753622321,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":146108,"content":"冒泡排序是一种简单的排序算法，核心思想是通过重复比较相邻的元素并交换位置，让较大（或较小）的元素像“气泡”一样逐渐“浮”到数列的顶端。\n \n基本原理\n \n1. 从数列的第一个元素开始，依次比较相邻的两个元素。\n2. 如果前一个元素比后一个元素大（假设要按升序排列），就交换它们的位置。\n3. 一轮比较结束后，最大的元素会“冒泡”到数列的末尾。\n4. 重复以上过程，每轮排除已排好的最后一个元素，直到所有元素排序完成。\n \n示例\n \n比如对数列  [3, 1, 4, 2]  进行升序排序：\n \n- 第一轮：比较3和1（交换→[1,3,4,2]）→比较3和4（不换）→比较4和2（交换→[1,3,2,4]），最大的4到末尾。\n- 第二轮：比较1和3（不换）→比较3和2（交换→[1,2,3,4]），第二大的3到倒数第二位。\n- 第三轮：无交换，排序完成。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1753683301,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":401749,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"老师，能详细解释一下python文件的冒泡排序是什么吗？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":668987,"discussion_content":"冒泡排序是一种简单的排序算法，核心思想是通过重复比较相邻的元素并交换位置，让较大（或较小）的元素像“气泡”一样逐渐“浮”到数列的顶端。\n \n基本原理\n \n1. 从数列的第一个元素开始，依次比较相邻的两个元素。\n2. 如果前一个元素比后一个元素大（假设要按升序排列），就交换它们的位置。\n3. 一轮比较结束后，最大的元素会“冒泡”到数列的末尾。\n4. 重复以上过程，每轮排除已排好的最后一个元素，直到所有元素排序完成。\n \n示例\n \n比如对数列  [3, 1, 4, 2]  进行升序排序：\n \n- 第一轮：比较3和1（交换→[1,3,4,2]）→比较3和4（不换）→比较4和2（交换→[1,3,2,4]），最大的4到末尾。\n- 第二轮：比较1和3（不换）→比较3和2（交换→[1,2,3,4]），第二大的3到倒数第二位。\n- 第三轮：无交换，排序完成。","content_length":376,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1753683301,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":397396,"user_name":"Matthew","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2843865,"ip_address":"江苏","ucode":"96093089773740","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEKSVuNarJuDhBSvHY0giaq6yriceEBKiaKuc04wCYWOuso50noqDexaPJJibJN7PHwvcQppnzsDia1icZkw/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1738250597,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144194,"content":"请看下右下角的cursor tab的状态，自动补全应该是pro以上才能用的","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1738294827,"ip_address":"河北","comment_id":397396,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"我按照老师的案例操作，没有代码自动补全的提示，不知道是什么原因","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg",